# City bonds engine (Options flag not needed: tests sell through the desk). Sells a small
# ₡1,000 1-year bond, makes its first coupon due, lets a day pass, and redeems it in cleanup.
# Costs the city about ₡3 in interest.
name city bond: selling adds the face to cash; the first coupon is paid when due; redeeming removes it
bond-finances
issue-bond 1 1000
expect-log bonds: sold #
expect-bond-coupons 0
bond-backdate 30
run-days 1
expect-log coupon ₡
expect-bond-coupons 1
cleanup:
redeem-new-bonds
expect-log redemption ₡1,000
